Name: strawnt
Version: @VERSION@
Release: 1%{?dist}
Summary: StrawNT — Windows apps on Linux via Wine/Proton-GE
License: MIT AND LGPL-2.1-or-later
URL: https://github.com/StrawCoding/StrawNT
BuildArch: x86_64
Requires: glibc
Recommends: libvulkan1

%description
StrawNT product shell and CLI (execution_backend=wine, engine=proton-ge).
Powered by Wine. Does not claim full Windows or ranked anti-cheat.
Vendored Proton-GE is fetched/placed under STRAWNT_ROOT/third_party/proton-ge
(git-lfs / scripts/fetch-proton-ge.sh). Flatpak remains honest PARTIAL.

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
cp -a @ROOTFS@/. %{buildroot}/

%files
/usr/bin/strawnt
/usr/bin/strawnt-hub
/usr/lib/strawnt
/usr/share/applications/strawnt.desktop
/usr/share/applications/strawnt-open.desktop
/usr/share/applications/strawnt-hub.desktop
/usr/share/mime/packages/strawnt-win32.xml
/usr/share/metainfo/org.strawcoding.strawnt.metainfo.xml
/usr/share/doc/strawnt

%changelog
* Sat Aug 08 2026 StrawCoding <dev@strawcoding.org> - @VERSION@-1
- NTW7 packaging: deb/rpm + MIME + gui_local hub desktop (powered by Wine)
